WEBVTT

00:00:05.880 --> 00:00:11.260
The boy who came from the future 20 years after the time machine, Trunks, has a terrifying secret.

00:00:12.120 --> 00:00:16.040
Now, from this era, 3 years later,

00:00:16.100 --> 00:00:19.420
In the southern capital, an island 9 km southwest,

00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:21.770
A terrifying duo will appear.

00:00:21.990 --> 00:00:25.130
Who are they? Are they aliens?

00:00:25.990 --> 00:00:26.610
Return to the future.

00:00:34.030 --> 00:00:37.510
The five of them prepared for the battle and began their mission.

00:00:38.430 --> 00:00:51.020
What kind of battle awaits the five of them?

00:05:06.010 --> 00:05:06.490
Why are the letters red?

00:05:07.720 --> 00:05:09.380
It means that the debt is also a property.

00:05:10.920 --> 00:05:11.870
Debt?
